{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-23009","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23009-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23009-0","text":"毁灭命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23009-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23009-1","text":"他每年都会来这里，带来几把新的剑。\n所有剑的主人，他都见过他们的最后一面。\n每当他离开，都会不无遗憾地想……\n\n自己的剑，何时才会被人带来此处。","speaker":""}]}
